@startuml otcp_state_deck
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 100
[*] --> Empty : New deck
Empty --> GuestDraft : edit (no account)
GuestDraft --> GuestDraft : edit / validate / export
GuestDraft --> SigningIn : Save or Share
SigningIn --> Saved : auth ok + upsert
SigningIn --> GuestDraft : cancel / fail
Saved --> Saved : edit + save
Saved --> ShareActive : create share link
ShareActive --> Saved : revoke share
Saved --> Empty : delete deck
Saved --> Purging : delete account
GuestDraft --> Purging : delete account\n(local clear)
Purging --> [*] : hard-deleted now;\nbackups within 30 days
GuestDraft --> [*] : clear site data
note right of GuestDraft : browser storage only\n(FR-27)
note right of Saved : Supabase RLS\n(ADR-006)
@enduml
